		{"id":"626b6b074cd59426","type":"text","text":"# documentation about the documentation\n- [[dokumentation in SEAD.docx]] is a file created by Martina Nilsson in 2024 to summarise the sorts of documentation that SEAD should have, This document may not be complete\n \n","x":-180,"y":380,"width":360,"height":280},
